{"id":"NCT02838927","title":"Survey on Epidemiology of Hypoparathyroidism in France","official":"Epi-Hypo: Survey on Epidemiology of Hypoparathyroidism in France","summary":"Very few data has been published on the epidemiology of hypoparathyroidism worldwide: none exists specifically for France. Hypoparathyroidism could led to complications. Here, the investigators plan to collect data about both epidemiology, medication and complication of hypoparathyroidism in France.","conditions":["Hypoparathyroidism"],"interventions":[{"type":"OTHER","name":"No intervention"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* patient fro whom chronic hypoparathyroidism is diagnosed\n* patient living in France\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* patient who does not want his data to be collected in this registry\n* pseudo-hypoparathyroidism\n* acute hypoparathyroidism","minAge":"","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":3000,"start":"2016-07","pcd":"2030-09","upd":"2024-09-24","sponsor":"European Georges Pompidou Hospital","areas":["other"],"central":["Jean-Philippe Bertocchio, MD, PhD · 800-555-5555 · jpbertocchio@gmail.com","Pascal Houillier, MD, PhD · 800-555-5555 · pascal.houillier@aphp.fr"],"sites":[{"f":"Felix Guyon Hospital","city":"Saint-Denis","pr":"","zip":"","s":"R","lat":48.9356,"lon":2.3539,"c":"Xavier Debussche, MD · 33262905610 · xavier.debussche@chu-reunion.fr"},{"f":"Hôpital Privé de Provence","city":"Aix-en-Provence","pr":"","zip":"13100","s":"R","lat":43.5283,"lon":5.4497,"c":"Nicolas Dervaux, MD"},{"f":"Amiens University Hospital","city":"Amiens","pr":"","zip":"80054","s":"R","lat":49.9,"lon":2.3,"c":"Rachel Desailloud, MD · desailloud.rachel@chu-amiens.fr"},{"f":"Clinic Auch Area","city":"Auch","pr":"","zip":"","s":"R","lat":43.6456,"lon":0.5886,"c":"Stéphane Castillo-Ros, MD · 33562051340 · stephane.castillo-ros@wanadoo.fr"},{"f":"Henri Mondor Hospital","city":"Aurillac","pr":"","zip":"","s":"R","lat":44.9254,"lon":2.4398,"c